NeuraCity — Ethical AI & Privacy License (Summary)
--------------------------------------------------
This project is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPLv3),
with a commitment to transparency, user privacy, and ethical AI deployment.

Core principles:
1. All modified versions of NeuraCity, whether distributed or hosted as a service, 
   must remain open-source under the same license.
2. Any collection, storage, or processing of personal or sensor data using NeuraCity 
   must follow privacy laws (e.g., GDPR, India's DPDP Act) and must clearly inform 
   affected individuals.
3. No use of NeuraCity is permitted for surveillance, profiling, or decision-making 
   that violates human rights.
4. Commercial use is allowed, but only if you share your modifications back to 
   the community under AGPLv3.

